    "detailed_description": "Ninshi Masuta is a 2D action game, where you need to act fast and think like a ninja to keep yourself alive.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1249680/extras/b7002d94b010b633c498019bc24273e3.poster.avif?t=1729364855\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1249680/extras/b7002d94b010b633c498019bc24273e3.webm?t=1729364855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1249680/extras/b7002d94b010b633c498019bc24273e3.mp4?t=1729364855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Get ready to face more than 20 levels and 8 bosses to free the city from criminals.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1249680/extras/546fd2ce4fc05fb5dbc9e5d96e57d12d.poster.avif?t=1729364855\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1249680/extras/546fd2ce4fc05fb5dbc9e5d96e57d12d.webm?t=1729364855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1249680/extras/546fd2ce4fc05fb5dbc9e5d96e57d12d.mp4?t=1729364855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Incredible high resolution graphics running at 1080p and precise controls with fluent 60 frames per second.<br><br>Use weapons like shurikens and grenades, in addition to your fists to defeat your enemies.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1249680/extras/1f4c4b5892aaa71d71add0960061bd43.poster.avif?t=1729364855\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1249680/extras/1f4c4b5892aaa71d71add0960061bd43.webm?t=1729364855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1249680/extras/1f4c4b5892aaa71d71add0960061bd43.mp4?t=1729364855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><i>Features</i></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>20+ levels to beat<br></li><li>High resolution graphics<br></li><li>Gamepad support<br></li><li>Mode for 2 simultaneous players locally<br></li><li>Leaderboards<br></li><li>Achievements<br></li><li>Sound Test</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Ninshi Masuta is a 2D action game, where you need to act fast and think like a ninja to keep yourself alive.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1249680/extras/b7002d94b010b633c498019bc24273e3.poster.avif?t=1729364855\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1249680/extras/b7002d94b010b633c498019bc24273e3.webm?t=1729364855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1249680/extras/b7002d94b010b633c498019bc24273e3.mp4?t=1729364855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Get ready to face more than 20 levels and 8 bosses to free the city from criminals.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1249680/extras/546fd2ce4fc05fb5dbc9e5d96e57d12d.poster.avif?t=1729364855\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1249680/extras/546fd2ce4fc05fb5dbc9e5d96e57d12d.webm?t=1729364855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1249680/extras/546fd2ce4fc05fb5dbc9e5d96e57d12d.mp4?t=1729364855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Incredible high resolution graphics running at 1080p and precise controls with fluent 60 frames per second.<br><br>Use weapons like shurikens and grenades, in addition to your fists to defeat your enemies.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1249680/extras/1f4c4b5892aaa71d71add0960061bd43.poster.avif?t=1729364855\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1249680/extras/1f4c4b5892aaa71d71add0960061bd43.webm?t=1729364855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1249680/extras/1f4c4b5892aaa71d71add0960061bd43.mp4?t=1729364855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><i>Features</i></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>20+ levels to beat<br></li><li>High resolution graphics<br></li><li>Gamepad support<br></li><li>Mode for 2 simultaneous players locally<br></li><li>Leaderboards<br></li><li>Achievements<br></li><li>Sound Test</li></ul>",
